# DXIL containers written by link5703.py's probe chain (the library, the
# linked shader, and the direct-compile control). All derived --
# `python ../../../scripts/triage.py run --issue 5703 ...` recreates them,
# and the readable result (the part list and the RDAT PRESENT/MISSING
# verdict) is what is committed, in out-*.txt, variant-*.txt and
# manual-case-*.txt.
*.dxo

# link5703.py's scratch directory for the containers above. Recreated
# (and wiped first) on every run; kept under the issue directory rather
# than the system temp dir so no per-machine username ever appears in a
# printed path (see link5703.py's `display_arg`).
work/
